{
  "id": "npc_sunergou",
  "title": "孙二狗对话",
  "description": "混迹黑风寨的丐帮卧底孙二狗（表面痞气，暗藏身份）",
  "start_node": "greeting",
  "metadata": {
    "npc_id": "sunergou",
    "npc_name": "孙二狗",
    "location": "黑风寨寨门"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greeting",
      "speaker": "sunergou",
      "text": "嘿嘿，这位爷面生得很啊。来咱们黑风寨做买卖？还是……（眼珠滴溜溜一转）寻仇？",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_fort",
          "text": "这寨子里是什么情形？",
          "next_node": "fort_talk"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_test_code",
          "text": "「五湖四海皆兄弟」",
          "next_node": "code_response",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": "sunergou",
              "value": 10,
              "operator": ">="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_leave",
          "text": "路过而已，告辞",
          "next_node": "farewell"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fort_talk",
      "speaker": "sunergou",
      "text": "嗨，能有什么情形——大当家坐镇聚义厅，弓手守寨墙，刺客巡暗哨，谁来谁倒霉呗。小的我就是个跑腿的杂役，爷有话吩咐就是，可别连累我丢了饭碗。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "sunergou",
          "value": 3,
          "reason": "打探寨内布防"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "farewell"
    },
    {
      "id": "code_response",
      "speaker": "sunergou",
      "text": "（神色一凛，压低声音）……「一方有难八方援」。原来是自家人。长话短说：寨中俘虏关在西边地牢，后夜三更守卫换岗有空档。这话你听过就忘，我也从没说过。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "sunergou",
          "value": 5,
          "reason": "对上丐帮切口"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "farewell"
    },
    {
      "id": "farewell",
      "speaker": "sunergou",
      "text": "爷慢走，慢走！（眨眼）这天下的路啊，走熟了都是一家人。",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "is_end": true
    }
  ]
}
